<title>USA: Deposit, Jefferson Guaranty finish merger.</title>
<headline>Deposit, Jefferson Guaranty finish merger.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSON, Miss. 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deposit Guaranty Corp completed its merger with Jefferson Guaranty Bancorp of Metairie, Louisiana and its wholly owned subsidiary Jefferson Guaranty Bank at close of business on January 3 1997.</p>
<p>From Monday Jefferson Guaranty, with $300 million in assets, will operate as Deposit Guaranty National Bank of Louisiana.</p>
<p>Deposit Guaranty is a multibank holding company based in Jackson, Mississippi with total assets of $6.182 billion as of September 30 1996.</p>
</text>
